From: postmarketOS mojito port
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: lpass-rx-macro: set the AUX DLY_Z enable bit

rx_macro_config_classh() passes the value 1 under the BIT(3) mask for
CDC_RX_RX2_DLY_Z_EN, which clears the bit it means to set. The vendor driver
sets it (register 0x504 reads 0x18 during stock playback).
---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/lpass-rx-macro.c	2026-11-23 03:57:40.000000000 +0500
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/lpass-rx-macro.c	2026-11-27 06:59:42.217345677 +0500
@@ -2389,7 +2389,8 @@
 	case INTERP_AUX:
 		snd_soc_component_update_bits(component,
 				CDC_RX_RXn_RX_PATH_CFG0(rx, 2),
-				CDC_RX_RX2_DLY_Z_EN_MASK, 1);
+				CDC_RX_RX2_DLY_Z_EN_MASK,
+				CDC_RX_RX2_DLY_Z_EN_MASK);
 		snd_soc_component_write_field(component,
 				CDC_RX_RXn_RX_PATH_CFG0(rx, 2),
 				CDC_RX_RX2_CLSH_EN_MASK, 1);
